  "title": "Amish White Bread",
  "description": "This white bread recipe will give you two perfect loaves of simple, sweet homemade bread — great for sandwiches or toast. And it&#39;s easy to make.",
  "authors": [
    "Peg"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-07-23T14:43:06-04:00",
